<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price of 100.60.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price of 100.60.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.5 percent 194th 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the 1.0 trillion yen issue, were as follows, the Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.60   Stop rate     2.425 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.62   Average yield 2.422 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.7039 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	591.26 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 96.1783 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   August 20, 1997 Maturity   June 20, 2007</p>
</text>
